# PERFORMANCE RULES FOR SONAR-TRACE

1. Initial JS bundle MUST remain under 200 KB gzipped.
2. All page routes MUST be lazy-loaded with React.lazy and wrapped in Suspense inside AppShell with PageSkeletonFallback.
3. Leaflet and leaflet.markercluster MUST only load dynamically when map features render.
4. Do NOT add new third-party npm packages without explicit permission.
5. Use thumbnailUrl (max 320px) with loading="lazy" and explicit width/height in lists and tables. Full resolution imageUrl is only loaded on detail/verification pages.
6. Enable preferCanvas: true in Leaflet and switch to L.circleMarker when detections count exceeds 500.
7. Wrap ClassChip, ConfidenceBadge, StatusBadge, table rows, and map markers in React.memo.
8. Debounce search inputs and sliders by 250 ms using useDebounce.
9. Keep TanStack Query staleTime set to 60000 ms with refetchOnWindowFocus: false.
